{"ticker":{"symbol":"054050.KQ","name":"NH농우바이오","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":6520.0,"change_pct":0.010852713178294504,"market_cap":104519254016.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.03834355828220859,"week52_low":6230.0,"week52_high":8840.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","country":"South Korea","city":"Suwon-si","employees":335,"website":"https://www.nongwoobio.com","business_summary":"NH Nongwoobio Co., Ltd. breeds, develops, and distributes seeds for various vegetables in South Korea and internationally. The company offers seeds for tomato, pepper, cabbage, kohlrabi, broccoli, cauliflower, Chinese cabbage, radish, cucumber, watermelon, melon, squash, gourd, carrot, onion, bunching onion, lettuce, pak choi, spinach, and sweet corn. It also distributes bed soil, fertilizer, and soil conditioner. The company was formerly known as Nongwoo Seed and changed its name to Nongwoobio Co., Ltd. in 2000. The company was founded in 1967 and is based in Suwon-si, South Korea. NH Nongwoobio Co., Ltd. operates as a subsidiary of NH Economic Holdings Co., Ltd.","business_summary_ko":"NH농우바이오(주)는 국내외 다양한 채소의 종자를 육종, 개발, 유통하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 토마토, 고추, 양배추, 콜라비, 브로콜리, 콜리플라워, 배추, 무, 오이, 수박, 멜론, 스쿼시, 박, 당근, 양파, 양파, 상추, 청경채, 시금치, 단옥수수의 씨앗을 제공합니다. 또한 상토, 비료, 토양개량제 등을 분배합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Nongwoo Seed로 알려져 있었고 2000년에 Nongwoobio Co., Ltd.로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1967년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 수원시에 본사를 두고 있습니다. NH농우바이오(주)는 NH경제홀딩스(주)의 자회사로 운영됩니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"농업자재","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":133399761830.0,"operating_income":11130852790.0,"net_income":9878674480.0,"eps":616.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":135843611780.0,"operating_income":8944808880.0,"net_income":10332644560.0,"eps":645.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":144680224580.0,"operating_income":11103130550